WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:00,787
Oh no!

2
00:00:01,587 --> 00:00:04,184
A muddy blob is climbing over the back fence at night!

3
00:00:04,984 --> 00:00:07,551
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:08,351 --> 00:00:09,788
This is Episode 49.

5
00:00:10,588 --> 00:00:11,495
Maya is asleep.

6
00:00:12,295 --> 00:00:13,362
But the owl is awake.

7
00:00:14,162 --> 00:00:15,959
Its head turns all the way around.

8
00:00:16,759 --> 00:00:18,636
It saw the blob come in the wrong way.

9
00:00:19,436 --> 00:00:21,033
The blob pushes the little door.

10
00:00:21,833 --> 00:00:23,810
Once, twice, three times.

11
00:00:24,610 --> 00:00:26,027
The owl counts every try.

12
00:00:26,827 --> 00:00:27,744
That is strange.

13
00:00:28,544 --> 00:00:29,411
The owl points.

14
00:00:30,211 --> 00:00:31,398
The little bell swings.

15
00:00:32,198 --> 00:00:33,295
The blob freezes.

16
00:00:34,095 --> 00:00:36,032
Maya wakes up and shoos the blob away.

17
00:00:36,832 --> 00:00:38,199
It rolls off down the street.

18
00:00:38,999 --> 00:00:39,456
Morning.

19
00:00:40,256 --> 00:00:42,703
Friends come up the front path, the normal way.

20
00:00:43,503 --> 00:00:44,680
The owl just nods.

21
00:00:45,480 --> 00:00:46,347
It knows normal.

22
00:00:47,147 --> 00:00:48,264
It spots strange.

23
00:00:49,064 --> 00:00:50,351
Now you know GuardDuty!

24
00:00:51,151 --> 00:00:53,048
Check out the Cloud Town book series.

25
00:00:53,848 --> 00:00:54,745
Link in the bio.

26
00:00:55,545 --> 00:00:56,502
See you next time!
